# Production build config for irStudy frontend.
# Origin-relative: the app is served on the same host as the API (behind Caddy),
# so these point at the current origin. Do NOT hardcode a hostname here — that
# keeps one build working across the tunnel URL and the real domain.
VITE_API_URL=/api/v1
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api/v1
# VITE_WS_URL intentionally unset -> WebSocket origin is derived from the page
# (wss://<current-host>). Set it only to point WebSockets at a different origin.
